じょうずに　あんないして▽
にんきを　あつめましょう▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="shimoyamada:W00184"
				Time="2011-09-24T03:29:26" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="nagihashi_toru:W00268"
				Time="2011-09-06T11:30:27" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>
選択肢６
案内するっての回答</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="shimoyamada:W00184"
				Time="2011-09-24T05:20:53" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>回答６
「おすすめを　おしえる」って？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="nagihashi_toru:W00268"
				Time="2011-09-06T11:30:27" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffffff</CellData>
